{"channelId":"UC0j6-3F0nxUWcPkeLUlZOBg","row":["Project Street Vet",13000,"Project Street Vet is a 501 (c)(3) non-profit public charity that provides free veterinary care, treatment, and support to the pets of individuals experiencing homelessness and/or housing vulnerability. \n\nProject Street Vet was founded by Dr. Kwane Stewart, who for the past decade has provided free veterinary care to pets of people experiencing homelessness – walking areas of high homelessness to seek pets and pet parents in need. You can read his full bio here.\n\nWe are committed to protecting the human-animal bond that is so vital to the livelihood of pets and the people who love them. Leading with compassion, kindness, and no judgements, will we seek out and assist the pets and people who need it most.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0j6-3F0nxUWcPkeLUlZOBg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0j6-3F0nxUWcPkeLUlZOBg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:01.864Z","channelId":"UC0j6-3F0nxUWcPkeLUlZOBg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"cf415d05748e2b8058fa9c31dfcd863b7005033dd0d42ec9b458da1240b084c1","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"732bdb0dc8e263a8f596268e1ad05d8efe9c15d7c229ed7e58a5e89ebd1714eb"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0j6-3F0nxUWcPkeLUlZOBg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:25:53.643Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0j6-3F0nxUWcPkeLUlZOBg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":13000,"raw":"13K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0j6-3F0nxUWcPkeLUlZOBg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:01.864Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://www.projectstreetvet.org/","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:22.600Z"},{"url":"https://www.projectstreetvet.org/contact","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:24.467Z"},{"url":"https://www.projectstreetvet.org/who